--------------------------------
foreach_binary_op (非原地版本)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:21-60
--------------------------------

【签名】
    foreach_binary_op<T, Op>(
        tensors: TensorList,           # 输入tensor列表
        scalar: Tensor[scalar, T],     # 标量tensor (0维，1元素)
        alpha: Scalar = 1
    ) -> List[Tensor]

    约束:
    - scalar.dim() == 0 && scalar.numel() == 1
    - tensors[0].device() == scalar.device()

【算法】
    # Step 1: 创建输出列表
    vec_res = [empty_like(t) for t in tensors]

    # Step 2: 构造双层列表
    tensor_lists = [
        tensors.vec(),
        vec_res
    ]

    # Step 3: 多tensor并行操作
    multi_tensor_apply<2>(
        tensor_lists,
        BinaryOpScalarTensorFunctor<T, depth=2, r_args_depth=1, res_arg_index=1>(),
        Op<opmath_t>(),
        scalar.data_ptr<T>(),
        alpha.to<opmath_t>()
    )

    return vec_res

【并行模式】
    multi_tensor_apply: 并行处理多个tensor
    - depth=2: 处理2个tensor列表
    - r_args_depth=1: 1个只读参数列表
    - res_arg_index=1: 结果在第1个列表

【备注】
    - opmath_t: 计算精度类型，见 at::opmath_type<T>
    - BinaryOpScalarTensorFunctor: 实际执行 op(tensor_elem, scalar, alpha) 的functor

--------------------------------
foreach_binary_op_ (原地版本)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:62-95
--------------------------------

【签名】
    foreach_binary_op_<T, Op>(
        tensors: TensorList,           # 输入输出tensor列表 (原地修改)
        scalar: Tensor[scalar, T],     # 标量tensor (0维，1元素)
        alpha: Scalar = 1
    )

    约束:
    - scalar.dim() == 0 && scalar.numel() == 1
    - tensors[0].device() == scalar.device()

【算法】
    # Step 1: 构造单层列表 (原地操作)
    tensor_lists = [tensors.vec()]

    # Step 2: 多tensor并行操作
    multi_tensor_apply<1>(
        tensor_lists,
        BinaryOpScalarTensorFunctor<T, depth=1, r_args_depth=1, res_arg_index=0>(),
        Op<opmath_t>(),
        scalar.data_ptr<T>(),
        alpha.to<opmath_t>()
    )

    # Step 3: 更新所有tensor版本号
    increment_version(tensors)

【并行模式】
    multi_tensor_apply: 并行处理多个tensor
    - depth=1: 处理1个tensor列表 (原地)
    - r_args_depth=1: 1个只读参数列表
    - res_arg_index=0: 结果在第0个列表 (原地)

【备注】
    - increment_version: 标记tensor已被原地修改

--------------------------------
foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_cuda (非原地)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:189-192
--------------------------------

【签名】
    foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_cuda(
        tensors: TensorList,
        scalar: Tensor,
        alpha: Scalar
    ) -> List[Tensor]

【算法】
    check_foreach_api_restrictions(tensors)

    # 快速路径检查
    if not (can_use_fast_route(tensors, alpha) and 
            tensors[0].scalar_type() == scalar.scalar_type()):
        return foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_slow(tensors, scalar, alpha)

    return all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16<std::plus>(tensors, scalar, alpha)

【备注】
    - all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16: 分发到 foreach_binary_op，支持所有类型+复数+bool+half+bfloat16
    - 退化到 slow 路径时处理类型不匹配的情况

--------------------------------
foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_cuda_ (原地)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:189-192
--------------------------------

【签名】
    foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_cuda_(
        tensors: TensorList,
        scalar: Tensor,
        alpha: Scalar
    )

【算法】
    check_foreach_api_restrictions(tensors)

    # 快速路径检查
    if not (can_use_fast_route(tensors, alpha) and 
            tensors[0].scalar_type() == scalar.scalar_type()):
        foreach_tensor_add_tensor_kernel_slow_(tensors, scalar, alpha)
        return

    all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16_<std::plus>(tensors, scalar, alpha)

--------------------------------
foreach_tensor_mul_tensor_kernel_cuda (非原地)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:194-198
--------------------------------

【签名】
    foreach_tensor_mul_tensor_kernel_cuda(
        tensors: TensorList,
        scalar: Tensor
    ) -> List[Tensor]

【算法】
    # 标量tensor在CPU时退化到scalar版本
    if scalar.device().type() == DeviceType::CPU:
        return foreach_tensor_mul_scalar_kernel_cuda(tensors, scalar.item())

    check_foreach_api_restrictions(tensors)

    # 快速路径检查 (非除法操作)
    if not (can_use_fast_route(tensors, div_op=false) and 
            tensors[0].scalar_type() == scalar.scalar_type()):
        return foreach_tensor_mul_tensor_kernel_slow(tensors, scalar)

    return all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16<std::multiplies>(tensors, scalar)

