--------------------------------
all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16 (类型分发包装 - 非原地)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/ForeachBinaryOpScalarTensor.cu:159-173
--------------------------------

【签名】
    all_types_complex_bool_half_bfloat16<Op>(
        tensors: TensorList,
        scalar: Tensor,
        alpha: Scalar = 1
    ) -> List[Tensor]

【算法】
    return AT_DISPATCH_ALL_TYPES_AND_COMPLEX_AND3(
        kBool, kHalf, kBFloat16,
        tensors[0].scalar_type(),
        "foreach_binary_op_scalar_cuda",
        foreach_binary_op<scalar_t, Op>(tensors, scalar, alpha)
    )

【备注】
    - AT_DISPATCH_ALL_TYPES_AND_COMPLEX_AND3: 类型分发宏，支持所有标准类型+复数+bool+half+bfloat16

